        "selectedJapanese": null,
        "audioScript": null,
        "reviewed": false
      },
      "usageNoteEnglish": "むずかしい is an i-adjective placed directly before the noun (むずかしい ことば). The same phrase appears again in extension 3. In dialogue turn 4 the speaker answers that they ask the teacher the meanings of words (せんせいに ことばの いみを ききます).",
